{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/remote/sync_state_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T03:55:08.203201Z","id":"4291403fcd3d2143e4e85b65b61ba5c80bc7218095ad43be09e4a048602efa1c","body":{"detail":"For a recipient, _World.check computes newer as b.version > base && b.bundleVersion > bundleVersion, the same expression as lib/remote/sync_state.dart:66-72, from the same link fields the test hands to syncState. Any change to that formula that the test copies in the same edit passes, and the 'never ↓ for a head at or below what is held' property is not stated independently for recipients (for authors it is, at sync_state_test.dart:314-316).","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":298},"end":{"line":305},"content_hash":"5286e82796d0eebe81cec837917e3d264897e882ee5c28492a38edb6facbe6ce"},"suggested_fix":"State the recipient property from the model's history instead: ↓ only when the passed head's bundle is one the model has not taken (its public version is past every bundle the model took, and its bundle version is past the held one), plus 'never ↓ when the passed head is one already taken or older'.","summary":"The property test's recipient oracle restates syncState's recipient formula","tags":["review","tests","remote","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/remote/publisher_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T09:24:13.070284Z","id":"9f0b4f30b13b091969dc71eec8bba205e7b22b1d963adb8dcd7e734aa3453b05","body":{"detail":"The test starts publish(aid, version: 1) unawaited, calls settle() (test/support/fake_clock.dart:39-43: 50 awaits of Future.delayed(Duration.zero)), then reads (await me.store.entry(aid))!.link!.pendingBundle. The publish writes the bundle and the lineage entry with asynchronous file IO, which completes in real time, so under load the 50 turns can pass first. Observed: a 13-target just test-affected run on 817be1926 failed it once with '_TypeError: Null check operator used on a null value' at publisher_test.dart:312; two reruns alone with --cache_test_results=no passed.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":304},"end":{"line":312},"content_hash":"5ded1f1d306c28f227c40d86652dea200f984b2a936001d7acfb1421743cb221"},"suggested_fix":"Wait for the condition itself: poll the store on a FakeClock-driven retry (or expose the publish's first landing, e.g. Publisher.waiting holding aid) instead of a fixed number of turns.","summary":"'a publish while an earlier bundle is pending lands that one first…' fails under load: settle()'s 50 zero-length turns stand in for the first publish's file writes","tags":["area:remote","test","flaky","review","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/remote/publisher_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T10:33:26.459404Z","id":"13dfe8ff6b71655f83611ee4fc4add13749abd85c8be3ef75c689cb2d1e855c8","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:7adfdd847","summary":"The test now awaits Publisher.publishOrWait(aid, version: 1), which answers null once the v1 upload waits for a connection (after the pending record is written), instead of settle()'s fixed turns. bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:remote_publisher_test PASSED at 7adfdd847; just test-affected 0efee33d8 at 592ecbefd: 191 tests pass (target/t10b.log).","supersedes":"9f0b4f30b13b091969dc71eec8bba205e7b22b1d963adb8dcd7e734aa3453b05","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/remote/merge_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T14:18:46.380649Z","id":"8aaecec3c321574be48ee84d4116e4ea6beb7109faf7f4f9b6517013dd92751c","body":{"detail":"The Diverged group tests combine only on success. The offer's Discard (confirm false), a failing inspector and a cancel each take a path in Merger._combine (lib/remote/merge.dart:408-433) that must leave the live version, link.baseRemoteVersion here and in the core, and the public copy untouched. Only Bring vN into mine has the Discard test.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":334},"end":{"line":400},"content_hash":"503ab153e6f430cd10848a47399f68c87cbb79461b5c98fb4cc3f670f4e4c268"},"suggested_fix":"Add the three cases next to combine_publishes_head_plus_one, asserting currentVersion, baseRemoteVersion, remote.links[aid].remoteN and copy.versions.","summary":"No test pins combine's Discard, failed check or cancel leaving the app, its link base and the public copy as they were","tags":["review","tests","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/remote/merge_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T14:54:38.000030Z","id":"dfe969db439efce781d35b3669d69f179ed59083acc36b416fae42d2f72c571e","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:c77cdd3aa","summary":"test/remote/merge_test.dart 'a combine discarded, failing its check or cancelled leaves the app, its link and the public copy' pins all three (local version, live files, store and core base, public copy versions, no publish or link call); it fails with Merger._rebase moved before takeFiles. bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:remote_merge_test: PASSED.","supersedes":"8aaecec3c321574be48ee84d4116e4ea6beb7109faf7f4f9b6517013dd92751c","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/remote/publisher_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T14:54:38.070582Z","id":"d4723a3a4ab0777701e647d2c6ff291d24467ac9ec5f692427787d1365ed5bdf","body":{"detail":"'a pending bundle survives Disconnect and lands after the next sign-in' (here; Null check at line 316) waits with settle() (test/support/fake_clock.dart: 50 zero-delay turns) for the publish's export and file write; apps/clax_app/test/ui/remote_flows_test.dart:126 'after Disconnect, Publish signs in again…' failed the same way (tapVisible found no publish button). Both passed on reruns alone. Waiting on the condition (the pending bundle recorded) instead of a turn count would make them load-tolerant.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":309},"end":{"line":330},"content_hash":"5c6aff49c1f923d51a2195b074080558e3245859c4cbbded0e606d2794152eb9"},"summary":"Two tests failed once under a parallel Bazel run and passed alone: they wait a fixed number of event-loop turns for file IO","tags":["flaky","tests","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/remote/publisher_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T15:12:07.250224Z","id":"e8a681a52490c955db68fb3b67076bac5bc8f4b6242f6dc28e96e99cae9f9ecf","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:6dd17eea6e948a527caa3f3a87c5ba69383d0312","summary":"Fixed in 6dd17eea6: apps/clax_app/test/support/settle.dart settle(tester, finder)/settleUntil(tester, condition)/waitUntil(condition) wait on the condition each test names (2-minute stuck timeout), replacing the turn-counted settle in test/ui/bundle_flows_test.dart, test/ui/remote_flows_test.dart and the settle() calls of test/remote/publisher_test.dart, and every caller (app_remote, app_bundles, publish_sheet, share_sheet, bundle_entry_points, remote_card). Load runs: bazelisk test of ui_remote_flows_test, remote_publisher_test, ui_bundle_flows_test, app_remote_test, app_bundles_test, ui_publish_sheet_test, ui_share_sheet_test, ui_bundle_entry_points_test, ui_remote_card_test, queue_render_bridge_test, remote_checker_test with --runs_per_test=10 --local_test_jobs=8 --nocache_test_results: before (at 23cae4064) 'Executed 11 out of 11 tests: 10 tests pass and 1 fails locally', //apps/clax_app:ui_remote_flows_test 'FAILED in 1 out of 10' ('after Disconnect, Publish signs in again...': Bad state: No element at tapVisible, remote_flows_test.dart:172); after (at 6dd17eea6) 'Executed 11 out of 11 tests: 11 tests pass', all 110 runs passing.","supersedes":"d4723a3a4ab0777701e647d2c6ff291d24467ac9ec5f692427787d1365ed5bdf","tags":["session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
